sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Agent
    participant Tree as JSON Tree Index
    participant Docs as Raw Document Pages
    participant LLM

    User->>Agent: question
    Agent->>Tree: load full tree (small enough for one context window)
    Agent->>LLM: reason over tree structure + question
    LLM-->>Agent: ranked candidate node_ids + reasoning trace

    loop until sufficient or candidates exhausted
        Agent->>Docs: fetch raw content for top candidate node's page range
        Docs-->>Agent: section text
        Agent->>LLM: does this section answer the question?
        LLM-->>Agent: extracted info + sufficiency judgment
        alt insufficient
            Agent->>Agent: advance to next candidate node
        end
    end

    Agent-->>User: answer + cited node id / page range
